#. module: campus_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_website.core_homepage_docs
msgid ""
"Lecturers only need to enter the final numeric score (e.g. 85). The system "
"automatically converts it to a letter grade (A), multiplies the points (4.0)"
" by credits (SKS), and calculates the student's GPA without manual "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"Dosen hanya perlu memasukkan nilai numerik akhir (misal 85). Sistem secara "
"otomatis mengubahnya menjadi nilai huruf (A), mengalikan poin (4,0) dengan "
"SKS (SKS), dan menghitung IPK mahasiswa tanpa perhitungan manual."

#. module: campus_website
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:campus_website.core_homepage_docs
